</table>
<p id="A3.SS1.p2.12" class="ltx_p">Substituting <a href="#A3.E33" title="In C.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix C Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">33</span></a>, <a href="#A3.E34" title="In C.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix C Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>, and <a href="#A3.E35" title="In C.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix C Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">35</span></a> into the RHS of <a href="#A3.E32" title="In C.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix C Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">32</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A3.E36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E36X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
