<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.Ex93Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{(by Young's inequality with $p=q=2$, i.e., $\langle\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y}\rangle\leq\frac{1}{2}(\|\mathbf{x}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathbf{y}\|_{2}^{2})$)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>(by Young’s inequality with </mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mtext>, i.e., </mtext><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝐲</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{(by Young's inequality with $p=q=2$, i.e., $\langle\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y}\rangle\leq\frac{1}{2}(\|\mathbf{x}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathbf{y}\|_{2}^{2})$)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
