</table>
<p id="A5.SS1.p3.8" class="ltx_p">Substituting <a href="#A5.E56" title="In E.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix E Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">56</span></a>, <a href="#A5.E57" title="In E.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix E Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">57</span></a>, and <a href="#A5.E58" title="In E.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix E Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a> into the RHS of <a href="#A5.E55" title="In E.1 Upper bound of term A ‣ Appendix E Proof of ‣ Provable Last-Iterate Convergence for Multi-Objective Safe LLM Alignment via Optimistic Primal-Dual" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">55</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A5.E59" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A5.E59X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
